# Backend-related variables live in the repo root `.env` (see `/.env.example`).
# The API loads `../.env` from the `backend/` package path.
#
# Optional: profile vault (defaults: data/profile_documents, 15 MB/file, 25 files/user)
#   PROFILE_DOCUMENTS_UPLOAD_DIR=...
#
# Password reset mail (same vars as root `.env`):
#   RESEND_API_KEY + MAIL_FROM  — or  SMTP_HOST + SMTP_FROM (+ SMTP_USER/SMTP_PASSWORD if required)
# Without mail, reset links are logged at WARNING when you request a reset (local dev).
